        "pageid": 75798771,
        "ns": 0,
        "title": "Kamitsubaki City Under Construction",
        "extract": "Kamitsubaki City Under Construction (神椿市建設中。, Kamitsubaki-shi Kensetsu-chū.) is a Japanese mixed-media project created by Kamitsubaki Studio. It began in 2019 and consists of songs, videos, as well as a tabletop game and a video game. A rhythm game titled Kamitsubaki City Ensemble (神椿市協奏中。, Kamitsubaki-shi Kyōsō-chū.) was released on August 29, 2024, and an anime television series produced by SMDE aired from July to September 2025.\n\n",
